                "lines": [
                  "好，我先找杯子。你別又拿到沒洗的那個。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "later",
            "text": "我晚點，現在還有退件。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day5.m1-reply-coffee-later",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "11:37",
                "lines": [
                  "那我幫你留個杯子，回來叫你。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day5.box-question",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "12:06",
      "visibleFrom": "day.05",
      "unlock": [],
      "lines": [
        "樓上昨天是不是少了一箱紙本？剛剛又打來問。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day5.box-receipt",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
      "time": "12:07",
      "visibleFrom": "day.05",
      "unlock": [],
      "lines": [
        "窗口顯示已簽收。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day5.box-is-box",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "12:07",
      "visibleFrom": "day.05",
      "unlock": [],
      "lines": [
        "我知道回條到了。我剛剛找過，箱子沒放在那裡。"
      ],
      "replyPrompt": {
        "id": "prompt.day5.missing-box",
        "availableThrough": "day.05",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ask-signer",
            "text": "簽收人是誰？",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day5.reply.signer-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "12:08",
                "lines": [
                  "回條上只有窗口帳號，沒寫搬去哪裡。我把附件傳給你看。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day5.reply.signer-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "12:09",
                "lines": [
                  "我再問一下值班的。不然下午換人又得重講。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "wait-slip",
            "text": "先等移交單回來。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day5.reply.wait-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "12:08",
                "lines": [
                  "好，電話我先留著。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day5.reply.wait-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "12:09",
                "lines": [
                  "有單再跟我說，我去接。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ask-upstairs",
            "text": "要不要直接問樓上？",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day5.reply.upstairs-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "12:08",
                "lines": [
                  "剛打過。他們說還在等一樓送上去。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day5.reply.upstairs-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "12:09",
                "lines": [
                  "那我問一樓看看，你先忙。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
